      "content": "<p>The causal_conv1d_cuda.so binary in the environment is not compiled \nfor SM120 (Blackwell). Getting cudaErrorNoKernelImageForDevice on every \ntraining attempt. ptxas chmod fixes the triton issue but causal_conv1d \nstill fails. We cannot install a new version because the filesystem is \nread-only and pip has no internet. How are we supposed to fine-tune on \nthis GPU?</p>",
